omb</a>, Formorgar Mines during Ghazbaran's raid.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p> <b>Deathslicers</b> will get as close as possible to you, attacking with its strong Melee and heavy Energy-Based Spells. A deathslicer will retreat at 20  (0.24%, deep red) health.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\tUse a stronger monster such as a <a href=\"#/wiki/Demon\">Demon</a> to destroy it, when it's trapped. You can push it.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><i>There is no loot data for this creature. Please consider subtmitting loot logs for this creature using the Loot Statistics parser.</i>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Creatures\">Related Creatures</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body\">\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Traps\">Traps</span></h4>\n<div class=\"navigation-list-wrapper\"><ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Canopic%20Jar\">Canopic Jar</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Containment%20Crystal\">Containment Crystal</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cosmic%20Energy%20Prism%20A\">Cosmic Energy Prism A</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cosmic%20Energy%20Prism%20B\">Cosmic Energy Prism B</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cosmic%20Energy%20Prism%20C\">Cosmic Energy Prism C</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cosmic%20Energy%20Prism%20D\">Cosmic Energy Prism D</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Destroyed%20Pillar\">Destroyed Pillar</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Egg\">Dragon Egg</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Dispenser\">Dwarf Dispenser</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Eruption%20of%20Destruction\">Eruption of Destruction</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Eye%20of%20the%20Seven\">Eye of the Seven</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Fiery%20